/* A FOLDED SURFACE HAD NO VISIBILITY RULE OF ITS OWN, .fold, IN FLOW RATHER
   THAN ABSOLUTE, SHOWN EXACTLY WHEN ITS PARENT WAS. Games first, then
   Analytics: both have been unfolded now, round LV finished what KT started,
   and neither id sits inside another surface's host any more. .fold has no
   caller left; it is not reused for the next fold, because the next surface
   to lose its door is not decided by keeping a rule warm for it. */
