   tall, shrink the icons down": with the label gone the button's own
   height is the icon's alone, so the icon itself comes down to 48px here,
   the same figure the phone width below already measured against the
   44px tap floor. The hero overrides this with its own rule below rather
   than getting a second class, since chSvg already writes chv-hero-svg
   beside chv-svg on it. */
