   rail's own selected pool at a second size, which is Petra's own point,
   "same light at two sizes is what joins icon to hero." Carried by a wrap
   around the svg alone and not .chv-hero, which also holds the name above
   it: a pseudo element positioned over the whole hero div would centre on
   the name and the face together, pulling the pool's own middle up off the
   face it is meant to sit on. Centred at 49% down rather than 50%, because
   the egg's own widest line sits 40.7% down the FACE (DESIGN-character-
   effects.md 1), and the face sits inside a grid box with blank rows above
   and below it (CH_Y0 to CH_Y0+CH_S), so the same point lands 49% down the
   full box: (11.02-2.2)/18. Sized 60% rather than closest-side, which is
