   thing that ever moved on this page, on its own 6s, and 9 of the 14
   reference profiles never reach rd.sup in the default Dark reading, so
   the page stood still for most of them. The archetype's glow now breathes
   for every read mask regardless, on the Field's own 4.2 second wave
   (0.82+0.18 sin(2 pi t/4.2), ui/wheel.js), and the rim joins that same
   beat, same token, once it lights, so six faces read as one character on
   one clock and the reward stays legible as the rim lighting at all. */
.chv-stage .chv-glow,.chv-stage .chv-rim-on{animation:chvBreath var(--t-breath) var(--ease-breath) infinite}
