/* THE SELECTED POOL JOINS THE SAME QUIET, round NK: it is carried on the
   same chvBreath keyframe as the glow and the rim above it, so whatever
   turns those still has to turn this still too, or a reduced motion
   profile would have stopped two things on the face and left a third
   pulsing behind the chosen icon. */
