/* ============================================================
   OPTION TWO, BEHIND ?rail=2, round OM. His words: "Have the colors represent
   them. And then mock up both options." Option one is the rows as they stand,
   a bar a reading with the colour doing the work. This is the other: the same
   six readings, the same markup, the same data, drawn as fields of colour.
   Each reading is a tile tinted by its own ramp colour with a ring carrying
   the figure, the mark in the middle and the name under it, and the number
   goes to the tooltip: the colour says how it is and the ring says how much.
   Coherence, vitality, awareness and will are the four rings. Decoherence is
   the seven seat marks in a tile of their own, and flow is the wave across
   the foot. Nothing here changes a gate: the page opens on option one and this
